(7167792, 1100065, 91496, '<td valign="top">Very powerful composition.  I love the vignette (either real or added).  Not sure if this is a bulb or if hte bulb is hidden by a dome which would not meet the challnege as well.</td>', 'Very powerful composition.  I love the vignette (either real or added).  Not sure if this is a bulb or if hte bulb is hidden by a dome which would not meet the challnege as well.', '2014-02-02 12:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
